<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 300 MLN OF ITS BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 300 MLN OF ITS BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 150 million zlotys of its 182-day NBP-bills and</p>
<p>150 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills, the bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - Sept 2, 1996</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - Mar 3, 1997, June 2, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
